9460/extras/ab81b07b4b772ceeb7e423d74b8f960d.mp4?t=1729540701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character growth</strong><br>Choices made through the story dictate Eve\u2019s progression: either following the path of Knight\u2019s Valour or choosing to be a Force of Nightmares, offer the player a diverse approach to the game.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2839460/extras/8dbab5ff7873aee4b6787a537f6a77cb.poster.avif?t=1729540701\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2839460/extras/8dbab5ff7873aee4b6787a537f6a77cb.webm?t=1729540701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2839460/extras/8dbab5ff7873aee4b6787a537f6a77cb.mp4?t=1729540701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sweet creature, which naturally behaves like a &quot;disgusting little monster&quot;. Eve interacts with an alien world, inhabited by Demons and Knights who constantly tease and mistreat them due to their meek appearance, in spite of their key role in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2839460/extras/b53c255801d7648063e8a553c00e361c.avif?t=1729540701\" width=800 height=1132 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIGHTING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Underestimating the Sleeping Spirit is a mistake made by many, after all, who wouldn't? Just from their appearance, they don't look like a sharp-minded creature, and they certainly don't seem capable of wielding any weapon properly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, the Sleeping Spirit is a legendary creature with hidden powers. Their claw strikes have good range due to the shockwave they generate, ripping through just as a chainsaw repeatedly hitting a giant ketchup packet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2839460/extras/447a87c856a5f09508306a07df2a0da4.poster.avif?t=1729540701\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2839460/extras/447a87c856a5f09508306a07df2a0da4.webm?t=1729540701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2839460/extras/447a87c856a5f09508306a07df2a0da4.mp4?t=1729540701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EYES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Eyes are tied to the Force of Nightmares skill set, and can be used when Eve is in the \u201cberserk\u201d state. Every pair of Eyes can be obtained by choosing to tear them from a Boss or a key NPC encounter, unlocking new forms and skills for the \u201cberserk\u201d state.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2839460/extras/7301431ef76d9e7c04b8e97775b8e8a8.poster.avif?t=1729540701\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2839460/extras/7301431ef76d9e7c04b8e97775b8e8a8.webm?t=1729540701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2839460/extras/7301431ef76d9e7c04b8e97775b8e8a8.mp4?t=1729540701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SWORDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Swords allow the player to use the Knight Skills, if they obtain them during a level and do not collect Eyes. Every Sword has two slots for active and passive skills, varying from one another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2839460/extras/152b27b8c989af72a1654a36715ab858.poster.avif?t=1729540701\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2839460/extras/152b27b8c989af72a1654a36715ab858.webm?t=1729540701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2839460/extras/152b27b8c989af72a1654a36715ab858.mp4?t=1729540701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME EXPERIENCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>To be or not to be a monster?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's not easy being a little monster with bulging eyes, a hairy and stinky body in a ruthless world of armoured Knights and colossal monsters. No one respects you, and everyone either uses you or makes fun of you. Moreover, they've ripped out your eyes and sent you to destroy entire worlds when all you wanted was to sleep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eve of Destruction is based on the choices and emotional consequences they entail. The player is tempted by the simplicity of committing evil actions. In Level 0, the player can attack or help a blind Knight who, sensing the character's steps and smell, provokes him. If the player manages to kill him, the player gains a secret reward but loses a friend and support within the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2839460/extras/67c0ca8505a201d332f5c9f1700254ce.poster.avif?t=1729540701\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2839460/extras/67c0ca8505a201d332f5c9f1700254ce.webm?t=1729540701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2839460/extras/67c0ca8505a201d332f5c9f1700254ce.mp4?t=1729540701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A WONDERFUL WORLD IN RUINS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The backstory reveals the choices that led to the downfall of the Spirit Realm. Each character suffers from the choices made in the past and their consequences:\u00a0 Greater Demons have been defeated and imprisoned, Knights remember the traumas of all the wars experienced in the World of the Living and in the Spirit Realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2839460/extras/c35d51bf7bcd2c37146c053d483584a6.avif?t=1729540701\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2839460/extras_big/c35d51bf7bcd2c37146c053d483584a6.avif?t=1729540701 width=800 height=678 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Lost Satellite Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2839460/header.jpg?t=1729540701","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2839460/763953/4c74f4cd829150c39d3302e071f90655ed9e87b7/1750946466/dash_av1.mpd?t=1727690676","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2839460/763953/4c74f4cd829150c39d3302e071f90655ed9e87b7/1750946466/dash_h264.mpd?t=1727690676","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https: